  "description": "The whole 10-minute work in 3D: the score walks the pass from the wait to the acta. Each block is its own universe (a trencadis threshold, the night square, fire on liquid chrome, a crowd of light, a collage tower, a city of lines, liquid gold, a glass dawn), crossing in image tiles, with hand targets and words on the walls that guide the public.",
  "entry": "index.html",
